Instance:    hscic-a11-encounter
InstanceOf:  PAMBundleMessage
Title:       "HSCIC ADT^A11^ADT_A09 - Cancel Inpatient ADT-A11"
Description: "FHIR Message equivalent of the HSCIC ITK example ADT^A11^ADT_A09 (converted to HL7 v2.5.1). Mrs Francesca Editestpatient’s GP Dr Townley decides she needs to be admitted to the hospital for general medical checks and stronger medication. The Malton GP practice receptionist rings up the York Hospital to organise a referral. Miss Cortana the hospital receptionist takes the details of Mrs Editestpatient's surname, first initial, date of birth, street number and postcode. When she searches on the system, she can only find two Mrs T Editestpatient's with the same date of birth and postcode and chooses the first one. The inpatient admission is scheduled with Dr Darwin. Miss Cortana realises that upon opening the full record view which shows full surnames, she had chosen Mrs Ten Editestpatient. Both were born in the same month, live at the same address and have estimated date of birth flags. Wh"
