Instance:    hscic-a12-inout
InstanceOf:  PAMBundleMessage
Title:       "HSCIC ADT^A12^ADT_A09 - CancelTransferPatient ADT-A12"
Description: "FHIR Message equivalent of the HSCIC ITK example ADT^A12^ADT_A09 (converted to HL7 v2.5.1). Mrs Editestpatient was due to be transferred to the recovery ward following her interval appendicectomy procedure. Just after the procedure had completed as Mrs Editestpatient was being moved, there was a complication and she had to be brought back to the surgical ward. The transfer which had already been recorded on the system had to be cancelled. This was recorded by Dr Darwin, who had performed the procedure, using the PAS system so that information is updated in Surgery System."
