Description: "FHIR Message equivalent of the HSCIC ITK example ADT^A05^ADT_A05 (converted to HL7 v2.5.1). Mrs Editestpatient is being pre-admitted to hospital following a referral by her GP Dr Townley of the Malton GP Practice. She is put under the care of Dr. Darwin, who also attends to Mrs Editestpatient. Mrs Editestpatient is admitted for an inpatient spell under the speciality General Medicine. She has a recorded allergy to an anaesthetic agent and has been diagnosed with stress incontinence."
