Instance:    hscic-a25-pending
InstanceOf:  PAMBundleMessage
Title:       "HSCIC ADT^A25^ADT_A21 - CancelPendingDischarge ADT-A25"
Description: "FHIR Message equivalent of the HSCIC ITK example ADT^A25^ADT_A21 (converted to HL7 v2.5.1). Mrs Editestpatient was due to be discharged from recovery ward after her stay in hospital. In advance of moving Mrs Editestpatient, a pending discharge had been set up in the PAS by Miss Cortana the receptionist, to inform the pharmacy. However Dr Darwin the consulting doctor, observed that Mrs Editestpatient may not be discharged on 15th April 2010 1130AM so the pending discharge was cancelled and A25 message is triggered from PAS."
