Title:       "HSCIC ADT^A26^ADT_A21 - CancelPendingTransfer ADT-A26"
Description: "FHIR Message equivalent of the HSCIC ITK example ADT^A26^ADT_A21 (converted to HL7 v2.5.1). Mrs Editestpatient was due to be transferred to the surgical ward for her interval appendicectomy procedure. In advance of moving Mrs Editestpatient, a pending transfer had been set up in the PAS by Miss Cortana the receptionist, to inform the surgical ward. However Dr Darwin the consulting doctor, observed that Mrs Editestpatient was improving and may not require surgery after all and so the pending transfer was cancelled so that further tests could be carried out."
